WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.457
CABINET establishes new state of the art on all
three benchmarks.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:09.412
On WikiTQ it reaches sixty-nine point one percent
exact-match accuracy,

00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:14.996
outperforming the strongest baseline in each
category, including OmniTab, DATER,

00:00:15.076 --> 00:00:19.254
and fine-tuned Flan T5-xl by six point four, three
point two,

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:22.604
and four point seven absolute percentage points,

00:00:22.684 --> 00:00:27.839
and it beats much larger GPT-3 and Codex based
in-context learning methods.

00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:31.678
On FeTaQA it achieves a Sacre-BLEU of forty point five,

00:00:31.758 --> 00:00:36.285
and on WikiSQL it reaches eighty-nine point five
percent accuracy,

00:00:36.365 --> 00:00:38.448
pushing past the previous best.

00:00:38.528 --> 00:00:44.730
Notably all of this is achieved with a compact five
hundred sixty million parameter model.
